            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/identity+types"} identity types
            one could still define isProp by adding the formation, introduction, elimination, computation, and uniqueness rules for isProp:
          %p Formation rules for isProp types:
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
